Permissions under this license depend on compliance with its terms. If you
violate them, stop the unauthorized activity. Your permissions terminate if you
do not correct the violation within 30 days after receiving written notice from
an affected copyright holder. Further permission may be granted in writing.
This section does not terminate independently granted third-party rights or
rights that mandatory law protects.

